  "citation": "Rush J; Zalman C; Woerndle G; Hanna E; Bridgham S; Keller J (2021): SPRUCE Warming Promotes the Use of Organic Matter as an Electron Acceptor in a Peatland: Supporting Data. ORNL Terrestrial Ecosystem Science SFA. Dataset. doi:10.25581/SPRUCE.075/1582060",
